@baseUrl = http://localhost:5010

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### List Greenhouses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/greenhouses

### Create Greenhouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/greenhouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Greenhouse",
    "location": "Anamur"
}

### Get Greenhouse by Id (replace with real id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/greenhouses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create Device (replace greenhouseId with real id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sensor-1",
    "greenhouseId": "06de62c6-0251-436c-9bc6-c344696fed08"
}

### List Devices by Greenhouse (replace with real id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/greenhouse/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Rotate Token (replace with real id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/rotate-token


### Auth - Register (creates new org + admin user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "organizationName": "Test Org",
    "email": "admin@testorg.com",
    "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Auth - Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@testorg.com",
    "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Auth - Me (paste access token from login response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJjZGY0NGVkYy05NjhmLTQ5YTYtODFjMS01YjE2YTkyNThmMmQiLCJvcmdfaWQiOiIzZDBjOTllNC05YWRkLTRhOTEtYjkzNi01OTc0MDQ3MDhlN2YiLCJodHRwOi8vc2NoZW1hcy5taWNyb3NvZnQuY29tL3dzLzIwMDgvMDYvaWRlbnRpdHkvY2xhaW1zL3JvbGUiOiJBZG1pbiIsImV4cCI6MTc4MTM4OTMyOCwiaXNzIjoiU2Vuc1NlcmEiLCJhdWQiOiJTZW5zU2VyYSJ9.7h9tiec34nUa1lZZjnCqfoxPf5R8TRB3_TIAnv1ndKY

### Auth - Refresh (cookie is sent automatically by REST Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh

### Auth - Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout


