### Register Org A
POST http://localhost:5010/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "organizationName": "Org A", 
    "email": "a@aa.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Create greenhouse as A - copy id into @ghAId, accesToken into @tokenA
POST http://localhost:5010/api/greenhouses
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "A's Greenhouse",
    "location": "Anamur"
}

### Register Org B - copy accessToken into @tokenB
POST http://localhost:5010/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "organizationName": "Org B", 
    "email": "bb@b.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### List greenhouses as B - expect {}
GET http://localhost:5010/api/greenhouses
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### Get A's greenhouse as B - expect 404
GET http://localhost:5010/api/greenhouses/{{ghAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}